Day one: calculate your net worth and

848
00:27:24,221 --> 00:27:25,216
find your stage.

849
00:27:25,396 --> 00:27:27,922
Day two: set up autopay for every

850
00:27:27,922 --> 00:27:29,146
minimum payment.

851
00:27:29,326 --> 00:27:31,597
Day three: open a separate high yield

852
00:27:31,597 --> 00:27:34,051
savings account and automate a transfer.

853
00:27:34,401 --> 00:27:36,545
Day four: check that you're getting your

854
00:27:36,545 --> 00:27:37,617
full employer match.

855
00:27:37,797 --> 00:27:40,497
Day five: list your debts by interest

856
00:27:40,497 --> 00:27:40,862
rate.

857
00:27:41,042 --> 00:27:44,148
Day six: cancel one subscription and redirect

858
00:27:44,148 --> 00:27:44,838
